{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AppendixSurreals.collatz_period4","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.collatz_period4","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.qcollatz_period4_EOOO","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.qcollatz_period4_EOOO","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_period4.lean#L50-L61","doc":"**Period-4, word `EOOO`.** Forces\n`q·(q⁵+3q⁴+5q³+3q²−1)·P₁ = −(q⁴+3q³+6q²+6q+3)`; non-unit coefficient, so no\n`EOOO` 4-cycle. With the other words (and their rotations) this excludes every\nnontrivial period-4 cycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.qcollatz_period4_EOEO","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.qcollatz_period4_EOEO","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_period4.lean#L39-L48","doc":"**Period-4, word `EOEO`.** Forces `q·(2q²+3q+2)·P₁ = 2q²+3q+2`, i.e. (over an\nintegral domain) `q·P₁ = 1`: `P₁ = q⁻¹`, the fundamental 2-cycle traversed\ntwice. So `EOEO` is imprimitive — not a new period-4 cycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.qcollatz_period4_EEOO","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.qcollatz_period4_EEOO","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_period4.lean#L29-L37","doc":"**Period-4, word `EEOO`.** Forces `q·(2q²+3q+2)·P₂ = q²+2q+2`; non-unit\ncoefficient with no matching Skein element, so no `EEOO` 4-cycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.qcollatz_period4_EEEO","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.qcollatz_period4_EEEO","kind":"theorem","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/collatz_period4.lean#L21-L27","doc":"**Period-4, word `EEEO`.** Forces `q·(q³+4q²+5q+3)·P₃ = 1`; the coefficient is\na non-unit in `ℤ[q^{±1}]`, so no `EEEO` 4-cycle. ","signatureChunk":0}]}